# Test: the card viewer's points box shows a plain bar and the party's highest level ("LV" and two digits).
# Jian gets the Quetzalcoatl and Sasquatch cards; X, Items, Cards, A opens the viewer (on a build where the Cards
# category still opens it); Down shows the next card. Jian is set to level index 22 and Lucia (if in the party) 9:
# the box should read LV 23.
include boot_from_save
wait 100
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u8 0x0213BA29 1
poke u32 0x020B4664 22
poke u32 0x020B46C0 9
press X 3
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot bc_00
press Down 6
wait 30
shot bc_01
